<object id="UserAccount" label="UserAccount" tooltip="Represents Pet Owner, Admin, Veterinarian and Super Admin accounts using a role property rather than four duplicated classes. Role-specific profiles retain staff position and veterinarian license details. Super Admin assigns clinic access; veterinarians independently toggle booking acceptance at their assigned clinics and select a separate online-call calendar. Authentication, permissions and account tasks are supporting objects. Fields and operations are role-dependent: a pet owner cannot assign clinics or edit veterinarian availability. Today&apos;s My List and future booking tasks are views of assigned records, not new entity classes.
Supporting mappings: users, admin_profiles, veterinarian_profiles, user_auth_identities, api_access_tokens, email_otp_tokens, google_auth_onboarding_tokens, admin_feature_permissions, admin_feature_permission_audit, user_branch_assignments, veterinarian_booking_clinics, vet_schedules, pet_owner_todos"><mxCell style="swimlane;html=0;horizontal=1;startSize=30;align=center;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.2;rounded=0;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="638" y="135" width="174" height="270" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
