<object id="Pet" label="Pet" tooltip="Represents a patient independently of a single owner account. Ownership links and co-parent requests support shared pet access. Registration details, species/breed choices and status remain part of the patient identity. The same pet identifier links bookings, examinations, medical history, prescriptions and billing, so updated prescription plans remain synchronized to the correct pet.
Supporting mappings: pets_information, pet_ownership, pet_coparent_requests, pet_catalog_options"><mxCell style="swimlane;html=0;horizontal=1;startSize=30;align=center;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.2;rounded=0;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1128" y="135" width="134" height="206" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
