<object id="MedicalRecord" label="MedicalRecord" tooltip="Represents a pet-linked record group and its supporting clinical entries. Diagnosis results, prior history, vaccination records, allergies and medical certificates remain available in the electronic record. Owner update requests and their review history are supporting records, not automatic edits to verified clinical history. This is a logical record aggregate; it does not claim that vaccinations or certificates are columns in one SQL table.
Supporting mappings: pet_medical_record_groups, pet_medical_record_group_items, pet_vaccinations, pet_allergies, history_before_registration, pet_medical_certificates, pet_record_update_requests, pet_record_update_request_events"><mxCell style="swimlane;html=0;horizontal=1;startSize=30;align=center;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.2;rounded=0;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1102" y="413" width="186" height="206" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
