<object id="SystemOperations" label="SystemOperations" tooltip="A conceptual service facade for cross-cutting administration, not a new database table or a literal PHP class declaration. It summarizes role-authorized report generation, dashboard charts, staff activity history, media management and backup creation/download. Reporting reads existing records rather than maintaining a duplicate reporting database. Backup endpoints require an active Super Admin. The diagram shows authorized account use of the service; report inputs such as bookings, billing, inventory and care records are documented here rather than connecting this service to every class.
Supporting mappings: system_backups, system_backup_settings, domain:report_generator"><mxCell style="swimlane;html=0;horizontal=1;startSize=30;align=center;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.2;rounded=0;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1579" y="381" width="172" height="174" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
