<object id="CareSession" label="CareSession" tooltip="A common overview abstraction for grooming jobs and boarding/confinement stays. It is not a request to merge their tables or workflows. Grooming keeps job details, photos, events and veterinarian review. Boarding/confinement keeps room reservations, check-in/out, observations, documents, tasks and material use. Room-related fields and operations apply only to boarding/confinement; grooming uses its own service capacity. sourceId is interpreted together with careType, so unrelated table IDs are not treated as globally unique.
Supporting mappings: grooming_jobs, grooming_events, grooming_photos, grooming_reviews, boarding_assignments, boarding_documents, boarding_material_usages, boarding_observations, boarding_tasks, rooms, room_unit_statuses"><mxCell style="swimlane;html=0;horizontal=1;startSize=30;align=center;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.2;rounded=0;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="173" y="707" width="164" height="238" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
