<object id="PatientExamination" label="PatientExamination" tooltip="Represents the admin/assistant-led physical examination and its queue/assignment context. It retains chief complaint, symptoms and clinical signs, major/urgent symptoms, vital signs, physical findings and images. Starting examination marks the patient as undergoing physical examination in the assigned veterinarian&apos;s current-day list. examinedBy preserves who performed the assessment; assignedVet remains separately adjustable. Consent must be captured before completion. Walk-ins are supported without a booking. The physical-examination table comes from the current clinical_intakes migration, which is absent from the supplied SQL export.
Supporting mappings: clinical_intakes, queues, vet_queue_assignments"><mxCell style="swimlane;html=0;horizontal=1;startSize=30;align=center;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.2;rounded=0;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="625" y="787" width="200" height="286" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
