<object id="OnlineConsultation" label="OnlineConsultation" tooltip="Represents the remote call attached to an online booking. It keeps the scheduled call interval, meeting details, participation/status timestamps and reschedule history. Online availability remains distinct from clinic operating hours and clinic booking acceptance, while shared veterinarian conflict checking prevents overlapping onsite and remote appointments. Its diagnostic record can issue prescription plans and per-item schedules, just like an onsite diagnosis; a call does not require an onsite physical examination.
Supporting mappings: online_consultations, online_consultation_reschedules"><mxCell style="swimlane;html=0;horizontal=1;startSize=30;align=center;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.2;rounded=0;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1566" y="627" width="198" height="222" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
