<object id="InventoryItem" label="InventoryItem" tooltip="Represents a medicine, supply or product together with its stock-management details. Branch/location balances, batches, receipts, suppliers, stock movements, transfers and audit history remain supporting records. Care sessions and service material definitions reference inventory for consumption. Billing may reference an inventory item for a product charge. This simplification does not replace auditable movements with an untracked editable total.
Supporting mappings: inventory_items, inventory_branch_items, inventory_batches, inventory_locations, inventory_stock_movements, inventory_stock_receipts, inventory_stock_receipt_items, inventory_suppliers, inventory_transfers, inventory_transfer_items, inventory_action_audit"><mxCell style="swimlane;html=0;horizontal=1;startSize=30;align=center;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.2;rounded=0;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="170" y="1017" width="170" height="206" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
