<object id="ConsentRecord" label="ConsentRecord" tooltip="Represents a consent instance and its signed/physical document, template, patient/owner context and processing staff. Admin captures the initial owner consent during examination; the veterinarian can handle additional consent in diagnosis. Consent can also be tied to booking or visit context without an examination, so the optional association in the diagram is not a requirement that every consent record originated at intake. Signer, examined-by staff and assigned veterinarian are different responsibilities.
Supporting mappings: consent_form_records, consent_files"><mxCell style="swimlane;html=0;horizontal=1;startSize=30;align=center;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.2;rounded=0;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="619" y="1145" width="212" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
