<object id="PrescriptionPlan" label="PrescriptionPlan" tooltip="Represents a pet-specific, versioned prescription linked to an onsite or online diagnosis. New or amended content is synchronized to pet/veterinarian views; replacement versions supersede previous plans while keeping history. Owners can start selected medicines or all medicines and receive a navigation-linked update notification. The plan contains item definitions, but it does not force all medicines to share one start date or frequency. Empty diagnostic prescription content does not create a new plan.
Supporting mappings: prescription_plans, prescription_events"><mxCell style="swimlane;html=0;horizontal=1;startSize=30;align=center;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.2;rounded=0;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1109" y="985" width="172" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
