<object id="PrescriptionItem" label="PrescriptionItem" tooltip="Represents one medicine and its own dosing rules, instructions, duration, selected start date and dated completion occurrences. Daily time slots, hourly intervals or selected weekdays belong to the item, not the entire plan. Three-times-a-day defaults can use morning, noon and evening slots, with item-specific times retained. Starting an item generates its due checklist/calendar occurrences. Completing or skipping an occurrence updates that dated dose, not every medicine or every day. Occurrence rows remain stored separately in the implementation even though this paper diagram nests them under PrescriptionItem.
Supporting mappings: prescription_items, prescription_occurrences"><mxCell style="swimlane;html=0;horizontal=1;startSize=30;align=center;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#111111;fillColor=#ffffff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.2;rounded=0;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1573" y="921" width="184" height="254" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
